For each turn you spend stamina, you gain [0.7%, 1.3%, 1.8%, 2.2%, 2.5% (TL1-5)] resist all and [0.1%, 0.3%, 0.4%, 0.5%, 0.6% (TL1-5)] all resistances cap for 3 turns. The buff stacks up to 5 times, and each new application refreshes the duration.

Additionally, at talent level 5 and above, Breathing Room and Dauntless Challenger are 19% more effective.
